  "description": "Cyclocross, tackling the twisting, muddy, actioned packed cross racing circuits, the Dolan Sporco is designed to take your\nperformance to the next level.\n\nOur Dolan Sporco features a lightweight carbon\nframeset, specifically designed to create a nimble ride, ideal for those weaving winter circuits. 35mm tyre clearance, paired with the 12mm bolt thru-axles, ensures a responsive performance across the technical terrains. Cyclocross focused designed tubing prevents mud build-up in the worst of conditions,\nmaintaining a clean aesthetic appearance with the internally routed cable management. Constructed around an oversized BB86 bottom\nbracket, the Dolan Sporco provides race-level lateral stiffness ensuring all\neffort is sent to the drivetrain.\n\nBe a seasoned regular tackling the twisting, muddy, actioned packed cross racing circuits or it be your first winter of racing, the Dolan Sporco is designed to take your performance to the front of\nthe grid.",
